      "writtenOn": "2019-03-29T03:07:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"send_command()\" should be atomic, and send_command() should be retried, not wait_for_ack(). The reason is that the device tends to proceed the whole steps believing it sent ACK. I let the code retry \"wait_for_ack()\" only on ACKISH, and observed TIMEOUT and NACKs.",
